*.log
# TypeScript incremental-build cache — was accidentally committed for all 8 packages while
# dist/ (the actual output it tracks) is gitignored. On a fresh checkout, tsc's incremental
# logic trusts this stale file and believes outputs already exist, so it silently skips
# re-emitting some of them (e.g. domain's dist/index.d.ts) — breaks every downstream
# package's typecheck with a bogus "Cannot find module" error. Root cause of every CI run
# failing since the first commit (2026-08-19 fix).
*.tsbuildinfo
.env
.env.*.local
.DS_Store
